# "At the beginning of your end step, if you have the initiative": the intervening "if" (CR 603.4) is checked each end step. Bot1
# takes the initiative as the Seer enters (turn one) and it grows at the end of turns one and three. On turn four Bot2's Llanowar
# Elves deal combat damage to Bot1, so Bot2 takes the initiative (CR 725.2) and ventures; at the end of Bot1's turn five the Seer
# first attacks, unblocked, retaking it (and ventures into the Stash), and then grows once more. The player with the initiative also
# ventures at their own upkeep (CR 725.2), which on turn three is Lost Well and adds no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Passageway Seer
Island x2
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Passageway Seer.Cast
Bot1.Search(Forest)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Initiative = Bot1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Passageway Seer.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Modes(Lost Well)
[T4 Bot2.Attackers]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Passageway Seer.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
Bot2.Search(Island)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Initiative = Bot2
? Bot1.Life = 19
[T5 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Passageway Seer > Bot2)
Bot1.Modes(Stash)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Initiative = Bot1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Passageway Seer.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
[T6 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Passageway Seer.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Passageway Seer.Power = 5
